# editlisttest, a 283 by 339 dialog holding an EditableTextList over the six lines of its file txt (the list from 20 across, 17 down, each line 13 high), a
# TextField (centred 100 above the foot) and a Quit button (centred 50 above the foot): a click on the third line puts the cursor in it and edited is typed there,
# Return splits the line at the cursor; the TextField is clicked and hello typed into it; Quit disposes the dialog and the program ends by itself
move 60 55
click 1 60 55
wait
type edited
wait
key Return
wait
click 1 140 251
wait
type hello
wait
click 1 141 301
